-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p16 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p17 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p18 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p19 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p20 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p21 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p22 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p23 Copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_18__para_18-4/p24 Copies list; no rule.
